{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017fEh9BgFDFFkpSfzvtXTNR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心reframe：放弃model×item作为headline finding，整篇论文重心从\"variance source\n2\t  discovery\" 转向\"G-theory as a framework for metric-conditional evaluation reliability\"。\n3\t  新Claim 1：Metric-conditional reproducibility budgets——binary vs text-exact-match的G系数\n4\t  差异(0.611 vs 0.007)作为headline数字，这基于已完成的Llama数据，不依赖4-model结果。 新Claim 2：IRT vs G-theory直接对比——3.0-3.5×的item需求差异作为standalone\n5\t  finding， 论证G-theory捕获了IRT忽略的prompt/seed/ordering维度，这是文献中首个此类对比。 新Claim 3：原Claim\n6\t  1降为\"preliminary evidence\"——model×item在2-model设计中显著(26%) 但随模型数增加衰减至7%，讨论可能原因并标注为需更大规模验证。\n7\t  标题调整为\"Reproducibility Budgets for LLM Evaluation: Why G-theory Demands 3-4× More\n8\t  Items Than IRT\"—— 突出IRT对比而非方差分解。Contribution 4工具包升级为主要卖点之一。 温度分层分析(已完成)和6项方法学鲁棒性验证(已完成)成为论文方法学贡献的核心。\n9\t  仍投AAAI同一track，目标borderline（5.0-5.5/10），但有清晰的rebuttal策略。 若时间允许，将exp-002剩余benchmark数据作为camera-ready补充。\n10\t  关键风险：cross-benchmark gradient叙事完全不可用，论文失去\"cross-benchmark\"维度， scope收窄至\"single-benchmark\n11\t  deep dive + metric-conditional framework\"。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: 'exp-001: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study'\n16\t  plan_id: exp-001\n17\t  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n18\t    × 200 items。 Llama/Gemma已完成，Mistral完成，Qwen3完成但有部分数据质量问题(~3%条件因OOM重跑， 引入时间混淆)。4-model\n19\t    G-theory分析揭示2-model结果被Llama/Gemma架构差异放大。\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    total_records: 825600\n24\t    total_conditions: 5184\n25\t    models_completed: 4\n26\t    qwen3_data_quality_issues_pct: 3.2\n27\t    llama_single_model_item_id_pct: 61.1\n28\t    gemma_single_model_item_id_pct: 57.3\n29\t    mistral_single_model_item_id_pct: 59.8\n30\t    qwen3_single_model_item_id_pct: 55.2\n31\t    avg_single_model_item_id_pct: 58.4\n32\t    avg_single_model_G_binary: 0.594\n33\t    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n34\t    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 7.3\n35\t    cross_4model_model_pct: 18.6\n36\t    cross_4model_residual_pct: 19.8\n37\t    cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.2\n38\t    cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.9\n39\t    cross_4model_temp_pct: 1.1\n40\t    cross_4model_precision_pct: 0.8\n41\t    cross_4model_G_binary: 0.31\n42\t    two_model_model_x_item_pct: 26.2\n43\t    four_model_model_x_item_pct: 7.3\n44\t    interaction_decay_ratio: 3.59\n45\t    two_model_cross_G: 0.073\n46\t    four_model_cross_G: 0.31\n47\t    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.3\n48\t    infra_x_method_text_pct: 3.8\n49\t    precision_x_temperature_text_pct: 4.15\n50\t    llama_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.06\n51\t    gemma_bf16_fp32_gap_pp: 7.8\n52\t    mistral_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.09\n53\t    qwen3_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.12\n54\t    fp32_degradation_all_models_avg_pp: 7.2\n55\t  result_rationale: '2-model设计中26.2%的model×item交互源于Llama(decoder-only, GQA)与Gemma(decoder-only,\n56\t    grouped-query attention, 不同tokenizer)之间的架构最大化差异：两者在知识编码方式上 根本不同，导致同一item对Llama容易而对Gemma难（或反之）。加入Mistral(与Llama架构\n57\t    高度同源，同为Llama-family decoder)和Qwen3(类似架构但中文语料占比高)后， model facet的universe从\"两个极端\"扩展到\"四个含重叠的点\"。Mistral/Qwen3的item\n58\t    difficulty profile与Llama高度相关(r>0.85)，稀释了Gemma带来的交互方差。 统计上，2-model设计中model只有1个自由度，任何两模型间的系统差异都被完全分配到\n59\t    model×item交互项；4-model设计中model有3个自由度，交互被分散。model主效应从<1% 升至18.6%反映了模型间整体能力差异(Gemma\n60\t    73.2% vs Llama 66.4% vs Mistral 62.1% vs Qwen3 68.5%)在4-model设计中被正确分离。cross-model\n61\t    G从0.073回升至0.31意味着 item difficulty rankings在4模型间有moderate一致性——\"崩塌\"叙事不成立，但0.31仍\n62\t    远低于0.80的dependability阈值，model-specificity是真实存在的，只是程度被2-model 设计夸大了约3.6倍。infra×method在binary下仍<0.5%，text-exact-match下precision×\n63\t    temperature仍~4%，与Llama-only结果一致——这一finding是robust的。\n64\t\n65\t    '\n66\t  tables:\n67\t  - name: 'Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (4 models separately)'\n68\t    data:\n69\t      columns:\n70\t      - source\n71\t      - llama_pct\n72\t      - gemma_pct\n73\t      - mistral_pct\n74\t      - qwen3_pct\n75\t      - avg_pct\n76\t      rows:\n77\t      - - item_id\n78\t        - 61.1\n79\t        - 57.3\n80\t        - 59.8\n81\t        - 55.2\n82\t        - 58.4\n83\t      - - residual\n84\t        - 17.2\n85\t        - 19.8\n86\t        - 18.6\n87\t        - 21.3\n88\t        - 19.2\n89\t      - - prompt_template:item_id\n90\t        - 4.6\n91\t        - 5.1\n92\t        - 4.8\n93\t        - 5.9\n94\t        - 5.1\n95\t      - - seed:item_id\n96\t        - 4.7\n97\t        - 4.3\n98\t        - 4.5\n99\t        - 5.2\n100\t        - 4.7\n101\t      - - precision:item_id\n102\t        - 7.2\n103\t        - 8.1\n104\t        - 6.9\n105\t        - 6.3\n106\t        - 7.1\n107\t      - - temperature:item_id\n108\t        - 3.1\n109\t        - 3.5\n110\t        - 3.2\n111\t        - 3.8\n112\t        - 3.4\n113\t      - - temperature\n114\t        - 1.2\n115\t        - 1.0\n116\t        - 1.4\n117\t        - 1.1\n118\t        - 1.2\n119\t      - - precision\n120\t        - 0.5\n121\t        - 0.4\n122\t        - 0.3\n123\t        - 0.7\n124\t        - 0.5\n125\t      - - other_interactions\n126\t        - 0.4\n127\t        - 0.5\n128\t        - 0.5\n129\t        - 0.5\n130\t        - 0.5\n131\t  - name: 'Table 2: 2-model vs 4-model crossed variance decomposition'\n132\t    data:\n133\t      columns:\n134\t      - source\n135\t      - two_model_pct\n136\t      - four_model_pct\n137\t      - delta_pp\n138\t      rows:\n139\t      - - item_id\n140\t        - 37.9\n141\t        - 42.1\n142\t        - 4.2\n143\t      - - model_x_item\n144\t        - 26.2\n145\t        - 7.3\n146\t        - -18.9\n147\t      - - model\n148\t        - 0.8\n149\t        - 18.6\n150\t        - 17.8\n151\t      - - residual\n152\t        - 21.6\n153\t        - 19.8\n154\t        - -1.8\n155\t      - - prompt_template:item_id\n156\t        - 4.6\n157\t        - 4.2\n158\t        - -0.4\n159\t      - - seed:item_id\n160\t        - 4.7\n161\t        - 3.9\n162\t        - -0.8\n163\t      - - precision:item_id\n164\t        - 2.8\n165\t        - 2.4\n166\t        - -0.4\n167\t      - - temperature\n168\t        - 0.9\n169\t        - 1.1\n170\t        - 0.2\n171\t      - - precision\n172\t        - 0.3\n173\t        - 0.8\n174\t        - 0.5\n175\t  - name: 'Table 3: G-coefficients comparison'\n176\t    data:\n177\t      columns:\n178\t      - design\n179\t      - metric\n180\t      - G_coeff\n181\t      - se\n182\t      rows:\n183\t      - - single_model_avg\n184\t        - binary\n185\t        - 0.594\n186\t        - 0.032\n187\t      - - single_model_avg\n188\t        - text_exact\n189\t        - 0.008\n190\t        - 0.003\n191\t      - - 2_model_crossed\n192\t        - binary\n193\t        - 0.073\n194\t        - 0.018\n195\t      - - 4_model_crossed\n196\t        - binary\n197\t        - 0.31\n198\t        - 0.041\n199\t      - - 4_model_crossed\n200\t        - text_exact\n201\t        - 0.005\n202\t        - 0.002\n203\t  figures_description:\n204\t  - 'Fig 1: 并排stacked-bar图，左侧2-model右侧4-model方差分解。model×item从红色26.2%的大色块缩小为7.3%的窄条，model主效应从几乎不可见扩展为18.6%的蓝色块。视觉上''reveal''效果减弱——不再是dramatic\n205\t    collapse，而是moderate shift。'\n206\t  - 'Fig 2: 4模型间item difficulty rank correlation热力图。Llama-Mistral r=0.88, Llama-Qwen3\n207\t    r=0.82, Llama-Gemma r=0.61, Gemma-Mistral r=0.58。显示Gemma是outlier，解释为何2-model设计(恰好选了Llama+Gemma)夸大了交互。'\n208\t  analysis: '4-model结果对原Claim 1构成实质性削弱。model×item从26.2%降至7.3%意味着这不再是 \"second-largest\n209\t    source\"——它现在排在item_id(42.1%)、residual(19.8%)、model(18.6%) 之后，仅列第四。cross-model\n210\t    G从0.073升至0.31意味着\"崩塌\"叙事需要大幅修正。 但0.31仍远低于0.80，model-specificity仍然是一个真实现象。论文策略：将model×item\n211\t    降级为\"preliminary evidence\"，报告2-model和4-model结果，讨论sample size对 interaction estimation的影响(2-model只有1\n212\t    df for model)，标注需要8+模型验证。 转而将metric-conditional G差异(binary 0.594 vs text 0.008)和IRT对比作为headline。\n213\t    单模型方差分解的稳定性(4模型间item_id=55-61%)是一个正面发现——可以支撑 \"item dominance is robust across\n214\t    models\"的claim，但这是psychometrically expected 而非novel。\n215\t\n216\t    '\n217\t- name: 'exp-001b: Item resampling stability test'\n218\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n219\t  description: '3个独立200-item分层抽样(seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n220\t    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54条件/样本。测试item_id dominance是否依赖具体抽样。 在worst档中，resampling显示item_id有显著波动，200-item子集不够stable。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    total_samples: 3\n225\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n226\t    records_per_sample: 10800\n227\t    total_records: 32400\n228\t    sample_seed0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n229\t    sample_seed7_item_id_pct: 52.4\n230\t    sample_seed99_item_id_pct: 68.3\n231\t    item_id_mean_pct: 60.6\n232\t    item_id_sd_pct: 8.0\n233\t    item_id_cv: 0.132\n234\t    item_id_cv_strict: 0.3\n235\t    sample_seed0_G_binary: 0.611\n236\t    sample_seed7_G_binary: 0.528\n237\t    sample_seed99_G_binary: 0.697\n238\t    G_binary_mean: 0.612\n239\t    G_binary_sd: 0.085\n240\t    G_binary_cv: 0.139\n241\t    variance_structure_profile_corr_01: 0.82\n242\t    variance_structure_profile_corr_02: 0.71\n243\t    variance_structure_profile_corr_12: 0.77\n244\t    avg_profile_corr: 0.77\n245\t    sample_seed0_residual_pct: 17.2\n246\t    sample_seed7_residual_pct: 22.8\n247\t    sample_seed99_residual_pct: 13.1\n248\t    residual_cv: 0.28\n249\t    resampling_item_id_cv: 0.3\n250\t  result_rationale: '200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使使用分层抽样(按subject category)，每个category\n251\t    内部的item difficulty分布仍有大量变异。MMLU的57个subjects中，部分subjects只有 ~100题，200-item分层抽样在小subjects上可能只抽到2-3题，这些题的难度方差极大。\n252\t    seed 99的样本恰好抽到了更多高方差subjects(如abstract_algebra, formal_logic)中的 极端难度item，导致item_id膨胀至68.3%——这些item的p值接近0或1，Bernoulli方差\n253\t    p(1-p)很小，但它们与其他item的巨大difficulty差异推高了item_id方差成分。 seed 7的样本则抽到了更\"中等难度\"的集中分布，item间差异较小，item_id降至52.4%。\n254\t    CV=0.30意味着200-item子集的方差结构有约30%的相对变异——这不是catastrophic (方差ranking仍然是item_id > residual\n255\t    > others)，但足以让reviewer质疑具体百分比 的精确性。对论文的影响：不能把\"61.1%\"当作point estimate来报告，需要报告 range\n256\t    [52-68%]或CI。这削弱了精确数字的说服力，但\"item dominance\"的定性结论 (item_id始终是最大source)仍然成立。G系数的CV=0.14较低，说明reliability\n257\t    estimate本身比方差百分比更robust——这是一个可以强调的正面发现。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t  tables:\n261\t  - name: 'Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws'\n262\t    data:\n263\t      columns:\n264\t      - source\n265\t      - seed0_pct\n266\t      - seed7_pct\n267\t      - seed99_pct\n268\t      - mean_pct\n269\t      - sd_pct\n270\t      - cv\n271\t      rows:\n272\t      - - item_id\n273\t        - 61.1\n274\t        - 52.4\n275\t        - 68.3\n276\t        - 60.6\n277\t        - 8.0\n278\t        - 0.3\n279\t      - - residual\n280\t        - 17.2\n281\t        - 22.8\n282\t        - 13.1\n283\t        - 17.7\n284\t        - 4.9\n285\t        - 0.28\n286\t      - - precision:item_id\n287\t        - 7.2\n288\t        - 8.5\n289\t        - 5.8\n290\t        - 7.2\n291\t        - 1.4\n292\t        - 0.19\n293\t      - - prompt_template:item_id\n294\t        - 4.6\n295\t        - 5.9\n296\t        - 4.1\n297\t        - 4.9\n298\t        - 0.9\n299\t        - 0.19\n300\t      - - seed:item_id\n301\t        - 4.7\n302\t        - 5.1\n303\t        - 4.3\n304\t        - 4.7\n305\t        - 0.4\n306\t        - 0.09\n307\t      - - temperature:item_id\n308\t        - 3.1\n309\t        - 3.2\n310\t        - 2.9\n311\t        - 3.1\n312\t        - 0.2\n313\t        - 0.05\n314\t      - - temperature\n315\t        - 1.2\n316\t        - 1.1\n317\t        - 1.0\n318\t        - 1.1\n319\t        - 0.1\n320\t        - 0.09\n321\t      - - precision\n322\t        - 0.5\n323\t        - 0.6\n324\t        - 0.3\n325\t        - 0.5\n326\t        - 0.2\n327\t        - 0.33\n328\t  - name: 'Table 5: G-coefficient stability'\n329\t    data:\n330\t      columns:\n331\t      - metric\n332\t      - seed0_G\n333\t      - seed7_G\n334\t      - seed99_G\n335\t      - mean_G\n336\t      - sd_G\n337\t      - cv\n338\t      rows:\n339\t      - - binary\n340\t        - 0.611\n341\t        - 0.528\n342\t        - 0.697\n343\t        - 0.612\n344\t        - 0.085\n345\t        - 0.139\n346\t      - - text_exact\n347\t        - 0.007\n348\t        - 0.005\n349\t        - 0.009\n350\t        - 0.007\n351\t        - 0.002\n352\t        - 0.286\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'Fig 3: 三组200-item样本的方差分解并排stacked-bar。item_id始终是最大source但高度变化明显(52-68%)。添加误差线显示±1SD范围。'\n355\t  analysis: 'resampling结果对论文有双重影响。负面：具体百分比不可作为precise point estimate， 需要报告range或bootstrap\n356\t    CI，reviewer可以合理质疑\"为什么不用更大的item sample\"。 正面：item_id在所有3次抽样中都是最大的方差源(最低52.4%仍远超第二名residual的\n357\t    22.8%)，定性结论robust。G系数的较低变异(CV=0.14)意味着reliability estimate 本身是stable的——即使方差成分百分比波动，最终的reliability判断不变。\n358\t    论文策略：报告mean±SD而非point estimate，在Limitations中讨论200-item的局限性， 引用D-study中500+item的建议作为methodological回应。但这会让数字less\n359\t    punchy， reviewer可能觉得\"连自己的item sample都不stable，怎么能给别人开D-study budgets\"。\n360\t\n361\t    '\n362\t- name: 'exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (partial)'\n363\t  plan_id: exp-002\n364\t  description: '原计划4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings\n365\t    × 200 items on GSM8K/ARC/HellaSwag。在worst档中，仅完成GSM8K(1个模型完整 + 1个模型部分)和ARC-Challenge(1个模型部分)。HellaSwag未开始。\n366\t    时间被exp-001的4-model数据收集和debug消耗。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t  expected_results:\n370\t    gsm8k_models_completed: 1.5\n371\t    arc_models_completed: 0.7\n372\t    hellaswag_models_completed: 0\n373\t    total_benchmarks_with_usable_data: 2\n374\t    total_benchmarks_fully_completed: 0\n375\t    gsm8k_llama_records: 57600\n376\t    gsm8k_llama_conditions: 288\n377\t    gsm8k_llama_item_id_pct: 38.2\n378\t    gsm8k_llama_residual_pct: 31.4\n379\t    gsm8k_llama_prompt_template_item_id_pct: 12.8\n380\t    gsm8k_llama_seed_item_id_pct: 6.1\n381\t    gsm8k_llama_temperature_pct: 5.3\n382\t    gsm8k_llama_precision_item_id_pct: 2.9\n383\t    gsm8k_llama_precision_pct: 0.4\n384\t    gsm8k_llama_G_binary: 0.421\n385\t    gsm8k_llama_overall_accuracy: 0.487\n386\t    arc_llama_records: 40320\n387\t    arc_llama_conditions: 202\n388\t    arc_llama_item_id_pct: 54.7\n389\t    arc_llama_residual_pct: 20.3\n390\t    arc_llama_prompt_template_item_id_pct: 7.2\n391\t    arc_llama_G_binary: 0.563\n392\t    arc_llama_overall_accuracy: 0.531\n393\t    arc_data_quality_note: partial, missing T=0.7 conditions and orderings 3-4\n394\t    mmlu_item_id_pct: 61.1\n395\t    gsm8k_item_id_pct: 38.2\n396\t    arc_item_id_pct: 54.7\n397\t    benchmark_item_id_spread_pp: 22.9\n398\t    benchmark_gradient_rank_corr: 0.0\n399\t    mmlu_gsm8k_profile_corr: 0.42\n400\t    mmlu_arc_profile_corr: 0.78\n401\t    gsm8k_arc_profile_corr: 0.38\n402\t    gsm8k_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 1.1\n403\t    arc_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.6\n404\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是数学推理任务，与MMLU的知识检索本质不同。GSM8K的item_id仅38.2%(vs MMLU 61.1%)的原因：数学题的难度方差较小——大多数GSM8K题都需要类似步骤数的算术推理，\n405\t    item间difficulty差异不如MMLU(从trivia到advanced physics)那么大。相应地， prompt_template:item_id升至12.8%，因为chain-of-thought\n406\t    prompt的具体措辞对 推理过程影响更大(某些prompt引导更好的step-by-step分解)。residual升至31.4% 反映了推理任务的内在随机性——同一条件下模型可能走不同推理路径得到不同结果。\n407\t    temperature对GSM8K的影响更大(5.3% vs MMLU 1.2%)因为推理任务在T>0时的token sampling对中间步骤的影响会cascade到最终答案。ARC-Challenge(科学推理)的item_id\n408\t    54.7%介于MMLU和GSM8K之间，但仅有部分数据不能做firm conclusion。 关键问题：3个数据点(MMLU 61%, ARC 55%, GSM8K\n409\t    38%)没有形成任何可解释的梯度—— 按\"知识→推理\"排序是MMLU>ARC>GSM8K，看起来有趋势但(a)ARC也是部分数据， (b)HellaSwag缺失，(c)\n410\t    3个点无法区分线性趋势和噪声(任何3点都可以拟合线性)。 Rank correlation无法计算或为trivially 1.0(3个点完美排序)，无统计意义。\n411\t    infra×method在GSM8K上为1.1%(高于MMLU的<0.1%)，可能反映precision对推理中间 步骤的累积效应，但也可能是noise——CI会很宽。这个结果让\"separability\n412\t    is benchmark-conditional\"无法作为firm claim。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t  tables:\n416\t  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-benchmark variance decomposition (single-model Llama, binary)'\n417\t    data:\n418\t      columns:\n419\t      - source\n420\t      - mmlu_pct\n421\t      - gsm8k_pct\n422\t      - arc_partial_pct\n423\t      rows:\n424\t      - - item_id\n425\t        - 61.1\n426\t        - 38.2\n427\t        - 54.7\n428\t      - - residual\n429\t        - 17.2\n430\t        - 31.4\n431\t        - 20.3\n432\t      - - prompt_template:item_id\n433\t        - 4.6\n434\t        - 12.8\n435\t        - 7.2\n436\t      - - seed:item_id\n437\t        - 4.7\n438\t        - 6.1\n439\t        - 5.8\n440\t      - - temperature\n441\t        - 1.2\n442\t        - 5.3\n443\t        - 3.1\n444\t      - - precision:item_id\n445\t        - 7.2\n446\t        - 2.9\n447\t        - 5.2\n448\t      - - temperature:item_id\n449\t        - 3.1\n450\t        - 1.8\n451\t        - 2.4\n452\t      - - precision\n453\t        - 0.5\n454\t        - 0.4\n455\t        - 0.3\n456\t      - - other\n457\t        - 0.4\n458\t        - 1.1\n459\t        - 1.0\n460\t  - name: 'Table 7: G-coefficients by benchmark'\n461\t    data:\n462\t      columns:\n463\t      - benchmark\n464\t      - n_items\n465\t      - G_binary\n466\t      - G_text_exact\n467\t      - data_completeness\n468\t      rows:\n469\t      - - MMLU\n470\t        - 200\n471\t        - 0.611\n472\t        - 0.007\n473\t        - 100%\n474\t      - - GSM8K\n475\t        - 200\n476\t        - 0.421\n477\t        - 0.003\n478\t        - 100% (1 model)\n479\t      - - ARC-Challenge\n480\t        - 200\n481\t        - 0.563\n482\t        - 0.006\n483\t        - ~70% (1 model)\n484\t      - - HellaSwag\n485\t        - 200\n486\t        - null\n487\t        - null\n488\t        - 0%\n489\t  figures_description:\n490\t  - 'Fig 4: 3-benchmark stacked-bar图（MMLU/GSM8K/ARC），但ARC标注''partial data''虚线边框。没有清晰的monotonic梯度——更像是每个benchmark有自己的idiosyncratic方差签名。'\n491\t  analysis: 'exp-002的部分完成是worst档的核心打击之一。原计划的\"cross-benchmark gradient\" 需要4+ benchmarks才能做credible的趋势分析，现在只有1.5-2个可用benchmark。\n492\t    MMLU 61% vs GSM8K 38%的差异是real的，但2个数据点无法支撑\"gradient\"叙事—— reviewer会问\"这只是两个不同benchmark有不同方差结构，这不是trivially\n493\t    obvious吗？\" ARC的部分数据(54.7%)暗示MMLU和GSM8K之间可能有中间值，但数据不完整不能claim。 论文策略：完全放弃\"cross-benchmark\n494\t    gradient\"作为finding，改为在Discussion中 报告MMLU vs GSM8K的差异作为\"preliminary observation\n495\t    suggesting task-type dependence\"。GSM8K的数据可以用来支持\"metric-conditional\"叙事——GSM8K的\n496\t    G=0.421(vs MMLU 0.611)意味着reasoning benchmarks需要更多items，但这是 a secondary point。主要损失：论文scope从\"multi-benchmark\"收缩为\"primarily\n497\t    MMLU with limited cross-benchmark evidence\"。\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t- name: 'exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study'\n501\t  plan_id: exp-003\n502\t  description: '原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing on MMLU。\n503\t    在worst档中，exp-003完全缺失——第二种GPU类型从未获得。\n504\t\n505\t    '\n506\t  expected_results:\n507\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n508\t    gpu_types_available: 1\n509\t    second_gpu_acquired: false\n510\t    records_collected: 0\n511\t    blocking_reason: second GPU type not procured; Manager unable to allocate additional\n512\t      hardware within timeline\n513\t  result_rationale: 'exp-003的核心依赖是获得第二种GPU类型(如A100、H100或不同架构的consumer GPU)。 在worst档中，Manager未能在AAAI截稿前分配额外硬件——可能因预算审批延迟、\n514\t    GPU集群排队过长、或所需硬件型号不可用。没有第二种GPU，\"multi-hardware crossing\" 无法执行。论文只能在单一GPU(RTX PRO\n515\t    6000)上讨论\"numerical precision\"而非 \"hardware\"。这意味着Claim 2(Conditional Separability)中的\"infrastructure\"\n516\t    实际上仅限于\"precision facet on a single GPU architecture\"——reviewer会指出 这是一个substantial\n517\t    scope limitation。Yuan et al. (2025)记录的hardware-specific 差异(CUDA kernel implementation,\n518\t    memory bandwidth effects)完全无法验证。 但论文可以将此framing为\"precision is the infrastructure\n519\t    facet we can study; hardware crossing is future work\"——这是honest但weakens the contribution。\n520\t    exp-003的缺失也影响exp-004(无hardware数据可分析)和exp-005(deps on exp-003)。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables: []\n524\t  figures_description: []\n525\t  analysis: 'exp-003缺失是worst档的defining characteristic之一。impact chain: (1) Claim 2的\"infrastructure\"缩窄为\"precision\"；\n526\t    (2) exp-004的hardware分析完全消失； (3) exp-005被block； (4) \"fully crossed infrastructure\n527\t    × methodology\"的framing需要大幅qualifier； (5) 论文title如果含\"hardware\"需要修改。 Mitigation：将exp-003的缺失作为explicit\n528\t    limitation，引用Yuan et al. (2025)的 hardware结果作为motivation for future work，强调我们的precision分析是\n529\t    complementary而非替代。在rebuttal策略中准备\"we agree hardware crossing is essential and plan\n530\t    to include it in camera-ready\"（如果能在rebuttal期间拿到GPU）。\n531\t\n532\t    '\n533\t- name: 'exp-004: Comprehensive analysis (partial)'\n534\t  plan_id: exp-004\n535\t  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。在worst档中，缺失exp-003数据， exp-002仅有部分数据。分析范围大幅收缩。仍可执行的分析：\n536\t    (a) 4-model G-theory交叉分析(exp-001)，(b) bootstrap CIs，(c) IRT对比， (d) 温度分层，(e) 固定vs随机敏感性，(f)\n537\t    D-study投影。\n538\t\n539\t    '\n540\t  expected_results:\n541\t    planned_analyses: 17\n542\t    executable_analyses: 11\n543\t    blocked_analyses: 6\n544\t    irt_recommended_items_mmlu: 142\n545\t    gtheory_recommended_items_mmlu_practical: 468\n546\t    gtheory_recommended_items_mmlu_all_random: 498\n547\t    irt_vs_gtheory_item_ratio_practical: 3.3\n548\t    irt_vs_gtheory_item_ratio_all_random: 3.51\n549\t    irt_gtheory_gap_attribution:\n550\t      prompt_x_item_contribution_pct: 32\n551\t      seed_x_item_contribution_pct: 28\n552\t      ordering_residual_contribution_pct: 40\n553\t    item_id_pct_CI_95:\n554\t    - 56.8\n555\t    - 65.4\n556\t    model_x_item_4model_pct_CI_95:\n557\t    - 3.1\n558\t    - 12.8\n559\t    residual_pct_CI_95:\n560\t    - 15.3\n561\t    - 23.1\n562\t    G_binary_CI_95:\n563\t    - 0.571\n564\t    - 0.652\n565\t    cross_model_G_4model_CI_95:\n566\t    - 0.22\n567\t    - 0.4\n568\t    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_mean: 1.01\n569\t    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_range:\n570\t    - 0.96\n571\t    - 1.04\n572\t    G_all_random: 0.594\n573\t    G_temp_fixed: 0.628\n574\t    G_ordering_fixed: 0.641\n575\t    G_both_fixed: 0.664\n576\t    fixed_random_max_delta_G: 0.07\n577\t    d_study_items_G80_practical: 468\n578\t    d_study_items_G80_all_random: 498\n579\t    d_study_items_G90_practical: 1240\n580\t    d_study_items_G90_all_random: 1380\n581\t    d_study_14k_items_G_projected: 0.972\n582\t    bernoulli_variance_obs_variance_corr: 0.91\n583\t    null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n584\t    obs_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n585\t    min_detectable_interaction_pct: 0.8\n586\t    power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.94\n587\t    power_at_5pct_interaction: 0.99\n588\t    gpu_hours_for_G80_budget: 340\n589\t    gpu_hours_for_G90_budget: 890\n590\t  result_rationale: 'IRT vs G-theory对比是worst档中最重要的surviving finding。ratio降至3.3-3.5×\n591\t    (vs原预期的3.6-4.4×)因为：(1) IRT在4-model数据上估计更保守(142 items vs 原2-model数据的116 items)，缩小了分母差距；(2)\n592\t    G-theory的D-study在4-model 分析中因model×item降至7.3%而需要fewer items来compensate，numerator从510\n593\t    降至498。但3.3×仍然是substantial——意味着IRT忽略的facets(prompt, seed, ordering) 贡献了约70%的额外item需求。这个finding不依赖model×item的magnitude，因此\n594\t    在worst档中仍然robust。 Bootstrap CIs显示item_id的95% CI为[56.8, 65.4]，range=8.6pp——与exp-001b的\n595\t    resampling变异一致，进一步确认point estimate的精度有限。model×item的4-model CI为[3.1, 12.8]，range很宽(9.7pp)，包含0附近——reviewer可能argue\n596\t    \"model×item is not reliably different from zero with only 4 models\"。这是对原Claim\n597\t    1的 又一打击：不仅point estimate从26%降至7%，CI还包含了trivially small values。 Fixed vs random\n598\t    sensitivity分析显示delta仅0.070——这是一个正面结果，说明 facet classification choice对G影响不大，MD2\n599\t    defense成立。 D-study投影到14K items给出G=0.972——这回应了MD5 \"MMLU is unreliable\"的误读， 但468\n600\t    items for G≥0.80(vs原文510)的变化需要更新所有D-study tables。\n601\t\n602\t    '\n603\t  tables:\n604\t  - name: 'Table 8: IRT vs G-theory item requirements comparison'\n605\t    data:\n606\t      columns:\n607\t      - method\n608\t      - framework\n609\t      - recommended_items\n610\t      - target\n611\t      - accounts_for\n612\t      rows:\n613\t      - - IRT_2PL\n614\t        - IRT\n615\t        - 142\n616\t        - SE<0.3\n617\t        - item difficulty + discrimination\n618\t      - - G_practical\n619\t        - G-theory\n620\t        - 468\n621\t        - G≥0.80\n622\t        - item + prompt + seed + ordering (temp/prec fixed)\n623\t      - - G_all_random\n624\t        - G-theory\n625\t        - 498\n626\t        - G≥0.80\n627\t        - item + prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\n628\t      - - G_high_rel\n629\t        - G-theory\n630\t        - 1240\n631\t        - G≥0.90\n632\t        - item + prompt + seed + ordering (temp/prec fixed)\n633\t  - name: 'Table 9: Bootstrap CIs on 4-model variance components'\n634\t    data:\n635\t      columns:\n636\t      - source\n637\t      - point_est_pct\n638\t      - ci_lower\n639\t      - ci_upper\n640\t      - ci_width\n641\t      rows:\n642\t      - - item_id\n643\t        - 42.1\n644\t        - 36.5\n645\t        - 47.8\n646\t        - 11.3\n647\t      - - model\n648\t        - 18.6\n649\t        - 12.1\n650\t        - 25.4\n651\t        - 13.3\n652\t      - - residual\n653\t        - 19.8\n654\t        - 15.3\n655\t        - 23.1\n656\t        - 7.8\n657\t      - - model_x_item\n658\t        - 7.3\n659\t        - 3.1\n660\t        - 12.8\n661\t        - 9.7\n662\t      - - prompt_x_item\n663\t        - 4.2\n664\t        - 2.8\n665\t        - 5.9\n666\t        - 3.1\n667\t      - - seed_x_item\n668\t        - 3.9\n669\t        - 2.5\n670\t        - 5.6\n671\t        - 3.1\n672\t      - - precision_x_item\n673\t        - 2.4\n674\t        - 1.1\n675\t        - 4.0\n676\t        - 2.9\n677\t      - - temperature\n678\t        - 1.1\n679\t        - 0.4\n680\t        - 2.2\n681\t        - 1.8\n682\t  - name: 'Table 10: D-study projections (4-model, binary metric)'\n683\t    data:\n684\t      columns:\n685\t      - design\n686\t      - n_items\n687\t      - n_prompts\n688\t      - n_seeds\n689\t      - G_projected\n690\t      - ci_95\n691\t      rows:\n692\t      - - current_practice\n693\t        - 200\n694\t        - 1\n695\t        - 1\n696\t        - 0.594\n697\t        - '[0.571, 0.652]'\n698\t      - - practical_G80\n699\t        - 468\n700\t        - 2\n701\t        - 3\n702\t        - 0.801\n703\t        - '[0.782, 0.831]'\n704\t      - - all_random_G80\n705\t        - 498\n706\t        - 2\n707\t        - 3\n708\t        - 0.8\n709\t        - '[0.778, 0.825]'\n710\t      - - practical_G90\n711\t        - 1240\n712\t        - 3\n713\t        - 4\n714\t        - 0.901\n715\t        - '[0.887, 0.918]'\n716\t      - - full_mmlu\n717\t        - 14042\n718\t        - 6\n719\t        - 6\n720\t        - 0.972\n721\t        - '[0.968, 0.979]'\n722\t  - name: 'Table 11: Fixed vs random facet sensitivity (MD2)'\n723\t    data:\n724\t      columns:\n725\t      - configuration\n726\t      - G_binary\n727\t      - delta_from_all_random\n728\t      rows:\n729\t      - - all_random\n730\t        - 0.594\n731\t        - 0.0\n732\t      - - temp_fixed\n733\t        - 0.628\n734\t        - 0.034\n735\t      - - ordering_fixed\n736\t        - 0.641\n737\t        - 0.047\n738\t      - - temp+ordering_fixed\n739\t        - 0.664\n740\t        - 0.07\n741\t  - name: 'Table 12: Bootstrap vs Jackknife CI comparison (MD6)'\n742\t    data:\n743\t      columns:\n744\t      - component\n745\t      - bootstrap_ci_width\n746\t      - jackknife_ci_width\n747\t      - ratio\n748\t      rows:\n749\t      - - item_id\n750\t        - 8.6\n751\t        - 8.4\n752\t        - 1.02\n753\t      - - residual\n754\t        - 7.8\n755\t        - 8.1\n756\t        - 0.96\n757\t      - - model_x_item\n758\t        - 9.7\n759\t        - 9.4\n760\t        - 1.03\n761\t      - - prompt_x_item\n762\t        - 3.1\n763\t        - 3.0\n764\t        - 1.03\n765\t      - - G_binary\n766\t        - 0.081\n767\t        - 0.079\n768\t        - 1.03\n769\t  figures_description:\n770\t  - 'Fig 5: D-study curve — G vs item count，显示IRT曲线(陡峭上升，142 items达到目标)和G-theory曲线(缓慢上升，468\n771\t    items达到G≥0.80)。两曲线的gap用阴影标注，标签''cost of multi-facet reliability''。'\n772\t  - 'Fig 6: 温度分层G系数热力图 — 3 temperatures × 2 metrics。binary从T=0.0(0.760)降至T=0.7(0.549)，text_exact_match全部<0.01。'\n773\t  analysis: 'exp-004在worst档中的核心价值：IRT对比(3.3×)和方法学robustness package。 IRT对比是self-contained的——不需要4-model结果或cross-benchmark数据，完全基于\n774\t    已完成的单模型Llama MMLU数据。3.3×的ratio比原预期低，但仍是\"首个G-theory vs IRT直接对比\"的文献贡献。Bootstrap\n775\t    CIs的宽度(model×item CI包含接近0的值)进一步 支持将model×item降级为\"preliminary\"的策略。方法学robustness的6项验证全部\n776\t    基于exp-001 Llama数据，不受worst档的数据缺失影响——这是论文的\"guaranteed floor\"。 Missing analyses:\n777\t    hardware crossing(exp-003缺失)、full cross-benchmark gradient (exp-002不完整)、full logprob\n778\t    analysis across benchmarks(只能做MMLU)。 论文需要在Methods中明确标注哪些分析是\"planned but not completed\"。\n779\t\n780\t    '\n781\t- name: 'exp-005: 14B model extension'\n782\t  plan_id: exp-005\n783\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 在worst档中，因exp-003缺失(deps)且无可用的48GB+\n784\t    VRAM GPU而完全未执行。\n785\t\n786\t    '\n787\t  expected_results:\n788\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n789\t    blocking_reason: Depends on exp-003 (not completed); no 48GB+ VRAM GPU available\n790\t    records_collected: 0\n791\t  result_rationale: 'exp-005有两个blocking依赖：(1) exp-003需要先完成以确定multi-hardware protocol；\n792\t    (2) 14B模型需要≥48GB VRAM GPU(RTX PRO 6000的96GB可以跑，但如果被exp-001/002 占用则无法parallel执行)。在worst档中exp-003未完成，且GPU时间被P0实验消耗，\n793\t    P1实验无法启动。这意味着论文没有model scale的evidence——所有结论限于7-9B模型。 reviewer concern \"Missing\n794\t    scale validation\"完全无法回应。\n795\t\n796\t    '\n797\t  tables: []\n798\t  figures_description: []\n799\t  analysis: 'exp-005缺失意味着reviewer concern #6 \"Missing scale validation\"只能在Limitations\n800\t    中acknowledge。论文需要argue \"7-9B models represent the most commonly used open-weight\n801\t    model class\"并cite usage statistics。但sophisticated reviewer会 指出14B+模型可能有qualitatively\n802\t    different variance structure(更稳定的internal representations → lower item×model interaction)。这是一个honest\n803\t    limitation， 不fatal但weakens generalizability claims。\n804\t\n805\t    '\n806\t- name: 'exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study'\n807\t  plan_id: exp-006\n808\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 在worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU时间不足。\n809\t\n810\t    '\n811\t  expected_results:\n812\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n813\t    blocking_reason: P1 priority; GPU budget exhausted by P0 experiments\n814\t    records_collected: 0\n815\t  result_rationale: 'exp-006需要1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min each ≈ 430 GPU-hours。在worst档中\n816\t    P0实验消耗了大部分GPU预算(exp-001 ~100h实际可能超支至130h due to reruns， exp-002 ~80h for partial\n817\t    completion)，剩余GPU时间不足以执行P1实验。 此外，exp-006是encoder-only(RoBERTa) fine-tuning，与主论文的decoder\n818\t    LLM inference focus有methodological gap——即使完成，reviewer可能argue \"fine-tuning variance\n819\t    structure is a different question\"。在worst档的reframed narrative中(focus on metric-conditional\n820\t    reliability)，fine-tuning分析不是 核心贡献，缺失的impact有限。\n821\t\n822\t    '\n823\t  tables: []\n824\t  figures_description: []\n825\t  analysis: 'exp-006缺失不fatal。论文可以在Future Work中提到\"extending G-theory to fine-tuning\n826\t    variance decomposition\"作为natural extension。reviewer concern #5 \"No training-time\n827\t    analysis\"的回应是\"this paper focuses on inference-time evaluation reliability; fine-tuning\n828\t    stability is a complementary question studied by Dodge et al. (2020) and Sellam\n829\t    et al. (2022)\"。\n830\t\n831\t    '\n832\t- name: 'exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation'\n833\t  plan_id: exp-007\n834\t  description: 'LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，在worst档中未执行。\n835\t\n836\t    '\n837\t  expected_results:\n838\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n839\t    blocking_reason: P2 priority; not attempted within timeline\n840\t    records_collected: 0\n841\t  result_rationale: 'P2实验在worst档中完全被deprioritize。LayerCast是一个mitigation strategy的\n842\t    evaluation——属于\"nice to have\"而非核心贡献。论文可以在Discussion中提到 LayerCast作为\"practitioners\n843\t    can reduce precision-related variance via mixed precision strategies\"的建议，无需实验数据支撑(cite\n844\t    existing LayerCast papers)。\n845\t\n846\t    '\n847\t  tables: []\n848\t  figures_description: []\n849\t  analysis: '零影响。LayerCast从未进入任何版本的核心claims。\n850\t\n851\t    '\n852\t- name: 'exp-008: MATH benchmark'\n853\t  plan_id: exp-008\n854\t  description: 'MATH benchmark(200 items)测试reasoning-heavy任务的item dominance。 P2优先级且deps\n855\t    on exp-002，在worst档中未执行。\n856\t\n857\t    '\n858\t  expected_results:\n859\t    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n860\t    blocking_reason: P2 priority; depends on exp-002 (incomplete)\n861\t    records_collected: 0\n862\t  result_rationale: 'exp-008依赖exp-002的multi-benchmark infrastructure和protocol。exp-002本身\n863\t    在worst档中仅部分完成，exp-008作为P2自然被skip。MATH作为reasoning benchmark 可能会显示更低的item_id(类似GSM8K的38%)和更高的residual，但没有数据只能\n864\t    在Discussion中speculate。reviewer concern \"Only MMLU\"的回应依赖GSM8K的 部分数据(\"we have preliminary\n865\t    evidence from GSM8K suggesting task-type dependence\")。\n866\t\n867\t    '\n868\t  tables: []\n869\t  figures_description: []\n870\t  analysis: 'exp-008缺失加剧了\"primarily MMLU\"的scope limitation，但由于worst档已放弃 cross-benchmark\n871\t    gradient叙事，这个实验的缺失与narrative adjustment是consistent的。\n872\t\n873\t    '\n874\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61758983-af28-4ed0-aeee-c7c8e76b89a4","uuid":"4aea8d37-5cea-448e-8c1c-53c16787c080","timestamp":"2026-05-21T06:00:23.876Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044739/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心reframe：放弃model×item作为headline finding，整篇论文重心从\"variance source\n  discovery\" 转向\"G-theory as a framework for metric-conditional evaluation reliability\"。\n  新Claim 1：Metric-conditional reproducibility budgets——binary vs text-exact-match的G系数\n  差异(0.611 vs 0.007)作为headline数字，这基于已完成的Llama数据，不依赖4-model结果。 新Claim 2：IRT vs G-theory直接对比——3.0-3.5×的item需求差异作为standalone\n  finding， 论证G-theory捕获了IRT忽略的prompt/seed/ordering维度，这是文献中首个此类对比。 新Claim 3：原Claim\n  1降为\"preliminary evidence\"——model×item在2-model设计中显著(26%) 但随模型数增加衰减至7%，讨论可能原因并标注为需更大规模验证。\n  标题调整为\"Reproducibility Budgets for LLM Evaluation: Why G-theory Demands 3-4× More\n  Items Than IRT\"—— 突出IRT对比而非方差分解。Contribution 4工具包升级为主要卖点之一。 温度分层分析(已完成)和6项方法学鲁棒性验证(已完成)成为论文方法学贡献的核心。\n  仍投AAAI同一track，目标borderline（5.0-5.5/10），但有清晰的rebuttal策略。 若时间允许，将exp-002剩余benchmark数据作为camera-ready补充。\n  关键风险：cross-benchmark gradient叙事完全不可用，论文失去\"cross-benchmark\"维度， scope收窄至\"single-benchmark\n  deep dive + metric-conditional framework\"。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'exp-001: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study'\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models × 3 precisions × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings\n    × 200 items。 Llama/Gemma已完成，Mistral完成，Qwen3完成但有部分数据质量问题(~3%条件因OOM重跑， 引入时间混淆)。4-model\n    G-theory分析揭示2-model结果被Llama/Gemma架构差异放大。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 825600\n    total_conditions: 5184\n    models_completed: 4\n    qwen3_data_quality_issues_pct: 3.2\n    llama_single_model_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    gemma_single_model_item_id_pct: 57.3\n    mistral_single_model_item_id_pct: 59.8\n    qwen3_single_model_item_id_pct: 55.2\n    avg_single_model_item_id_pct: 58.4\n    avg_single_model_G_binary: 0.594\n    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 7.3\n    cross_4model_model_pct: 18.6\n    cross_4model_residual_pct: 19.8\n    cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 4.2\n    cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.9\n    cross_4model_temp_pct: 1.1\n    cross_4model_precision_pct: 0.8\n    cross_4model_G_binary: 0.31\n    two_model_model_x_item_pct: 26.2\n    four_model_model_x_item_pct: 7.3\n    interaction_decay_ratio: 3.59\n    two_model_cross_G: 0.073\n    four_model_cross_G: 0.31\n    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.3\n    infra_x_method_text_pct: 3.8\n    precision_x_temperature_text_pct: 4.15\n    llama_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.06\n    gemma_bf16_fp32_gap_pp: 7.8\n    mistral_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.09\n    qwen3_bf16_fp16_gap_pp: 0.12\n    fp32_degradation_all_models_avg_pp: 7.2\n  result_rationale: '2-model设计中26.2%的model×item交互源于Llama(decoder-only, GQA)与Gemma(decoder-only,\n    grouped-query attention, 不同tokenizer)之间的架构最大化差异：两者在知识编码方式上 根本不同，导致同一item对Llama容易而对Gemma难（或反之）。加入Mistral(与Llama架构\n    高度同源，同为Llama-family decoder)和Qwen3(类似架构但中文语料占比高)后， model facet的universe从\"两个极端\"扩展到\"四个含重叠的点\"。Mistral/Qwen3的item\n    difficulty profile与Llama高度相关(r>0.85)，稀释了Gemma带来的交互方差。 统计上，2-model设计中model只有1个自由度，任何两模型间的系统差异都被完全分配到\n    model×item交互项；4-model设计中model有3个自由度，交互被分散。model主效应从<1% 升至18.6%反映了模型间整体能力差异(Gemma\n    73.2% vs Llama 66.4% vs Mistral 62.1% vs Qwen3 68.5%)在4-model设计中被正确分离。cross-model\n    G从0.073回升至0.31意味着 item difficulty rankings在4模型间有moderate一致性——\"崩塌\"叙事不成立，但0.31仍\n    远低于0.80的dependability阈值，model-specificity是真实存在的，只是程度被2-model 设计夸大了约3.6倍。infra×method在binary下仍<0.5%，text-exact-match下precision×\n    temperature仍~4%，与Llama-only结果一致——这一finding是robust的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (4 models separately)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - llama_pct\n      - gemma_pct\n      - mistral_pct\n      - qwen3_pct\n      - avg_pct\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 61.1\n        - 57.3\n        - 59.8\n        - 55.2\n        - 58.4\n      - - residual\n        - 17.2\n        - 19.8\n        - 18.6\n        - 21.3\n        - 19.2\n      - - prompt_template:item_id\n        - 4.6\n        - 5.1\n        - 4.8\n        - 5.9\n        - 5.1\n      - - seed:item_id\n        - 4.7\n        - 4.3\n        - 4.5\n        - 5.2\n        - 4.7\n      - - precision:item_id\n        - 7.2\n        - 8.1\n        - 6.9\n        - 6.3\n        - 7.1\n      - - temperature:item_id\n        - 3.1\n        - 3.5\n        - 3.2\n        - 3.8\n        - 3.4\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 1.0\n        - 1.4\n        - 1.1\n        - 1.2\n      - - precision\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.7\n        - 0.5\n      - - other_interactions\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.5\n  - name: 'Table 2: 2-model vs 4-model crossed variance decomposition'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - two_model_pct\n      - four_model_pct\n      - delta_pp\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 37.9\n        - 42.1\n        - 4.2\n      - - model_x_item\n        - 26.2\n        - 7.3\n        - -18.9\n      - - model\n        - 0.8\n        - 18.6\n        - 17.8\n      - - residual\n        - 21.6\n        - 19.8\n        - -1.8\n      - - prompt_template:item_id\n        - 4.6\n        - 4.2\n        - -0.4\n      - - seed:item_id\n        - 4.7\n        - 3.9\n        - -0.8\n      - - precision:item_id\n        - 2.8\n        - 2.4\n        - -0.4\n      - - temperature\n        - 0.9\n        - 1.1\n        - 0.2\n      - - precision\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.8\n        - 0.5\n  - name: 'Table 3: G-coefficients comparison'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - design\n      - metric\n      - G_coeff\n      - se\n      rows:\n      - - single_model_avg\n        - binary\n        - 0.594\n        - 0.032\n      - - single_model_avg\n        - text_exact\n        - 0.008\n        - 0.003\n      - - 2_model_crossed\n        - binary\n        - 0.073\n        - 0.018\n      - - 4_model_crossed\n        - binary\n        - 0.31\n        - 0.041\n      - - 4_model_crossed\n        - text_exact\n        - 0.005\n        - 0.002\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: 并排stacked-bar图，左侧2-model右侧4-model方差分解。model×item从红色26.2%的大色块缩小为7.3%的窄条，model主效应从几乎不可见扩展为18.6%的蓝色块。视觉上''reveal''效果减弱——不再是dramatic\n    collapse，而是moderate shift。'\n  - 'Fig 2: 4模型间item difficulty rank correlation热力图。Llama-Mistral r=0.88, Llama-Qwen3\n    r=0.82, Llama-Gemma r=0.61, Gemma-Mistral r=0.58。显示Gemma是outlier，解释为何2-model设计(恰好选了Llama+Gemma)夸大了交互。'\n  analysis: '4-model结果对原Claim 1构成实质性削弱。model×item从26.2%降至7.3%意味着这不再是 \"second-largest\n    source\"——它现在排在item_id(42.1%)、residual(19.8%)、model(18.6%) 之后，仅列第四。cross-model\n    G从0.073升至0.31意味着\"崩塌\"叙事需要大幅修正。 但0.31仍远低于0.80，model-specificity仍然是一个真实现象。论文策略：将model×item\n    降级为\"preliminary evidence\"，报告2-model和4-model结果，讨论sample size对 interaction estimation的影响(2-model只有1\n    df for model)，标注需要8+模型验证。 转而将metric-conditional G差异(binary 0.594 vs text 0.008)和IRT对比作为headline。\n    单模型方差分解的稳定性(4模型间item_id=55-61%)是一个正面发现——可以支撑 \"item dominance is robust across\n    models\"的claim，但这是psychometrically expected 而非novel。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-001b: Item resampling stability test'\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3个独立200-item分层抽样(seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54条件/样本。测试item_id dominance是否依赖具体抽样。 在worst档中，resampling显示item_id有显著波动，200-item子集不够stable。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_samples: 3\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    records_per_sample: 10800\n    total_records: 32400\n    sample_seed0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    sample_seed7_item_id_pct: 52.4\n    sample_seed99_item_id_pct: 68.3\n    item_id_mean_pct: 60.6\n    item_id_sd_pct: 8.0\n    item_id_cv: 0.132\n    item_id_cv_strict: 0.3\n    sample_seed0_G_binary: 0.611\n    sample_seed7_G_binary: 0.528\n    sample_seed99_G_binary: 0.697\n    G_binary_mean: 0.612\n    G_binary_sd: 0.085\n    G_binary_cv: 0.139\n    variance_structure_profile_corr_01: 0.82\n    variance_structure_profile_corr_02: 0.71\n    variance_structure_profile_corr_12: 0.77\n    avg_profile_corr: 0.77\n    sample_seed0_residual_pct: 17.2\n    sample_seed7_residual_pct: 22.8\n    sample_seed99_residual_pct: 13.1\n    residual_cv: 0.28\n    resampling_item_id_cv: 0.3\n  result_rationale: '200 items是MMLU 14,042题的1.4%。即使使用分层抽样(按subject category)，每个category\n    内部的item difficulty分布仍有大量变异。MMLU的57个subjects中，部分subjects只有 ~100题，200-item分层抽样在小subjects上可能只抽到2-3题，这些题的难度方差极大。\n    seed 99的样本恰好抽到了更多高方差subjects(如abstract_algebra, formal_logic)中的 极端难度item，导致item_id膨胀至68.3%——这些item的p值接近0或1，Bernoulli方差\n    p(1-p)很小，但它们与其他item的巨大difficulty差异推高了item_id方差成分。 seed 7的样本则抽到了更\"中等难度\"的集中分布，item间差异较小，item_id降至52.4%。\n    CV=0.30意味着200-item子集的方差结构有约30%的相对变异——这不是catastrophic (方差ranking仍然是item_id > residual\n    > others)，但足以让reviewer质疑具体百分比 的精确性。对论文的影响：不能把\"61.1%\"当作point estimate来报告，需要报告 range\n    [52-68%]或CI。这削弱了精确数字的说服力，但\"item dominance\"的定性结论 (item_id始终是最大source)仍然成立。G系数的CV=0.14较低，说明reliability\n    estimate本身比方差百分比更robust——这是一个可以强调的正面发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Resampling stability across 3 item draws'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - seed0_pct\n      - seed7_pct\n      - seed99_pct\n      - mean_pct\n      - sd_pct\n      - cv\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 61.1\n        - 52.4\n        - 68.3\n        - 60.6\n        - 8.0\n        - 0.3\n      - - residual\n        - 17.2\n        - 22.8\n        - 13.1\n        - 17.7\n        - 4.9\n        - 0.28\n      - - precision:item_id\n        - 7.2\n        - 8.5\n        - 5.8\n        - 7.2\n        - 1.4\n        - 0.19\n      - - prompt_template:item_id\n        - 4.6\n        - 5.9\n        - 4.1\n        - 4.9\n        - 0.9\n        - 0.19\n      - - seed:item_id\n        - 4.7\n        - 5.1\n        - 4.3\n        - 4.7\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.09\n      - - temperature:item_id\n        - 3.1\n        - 3.2\n        - 2.9\n        - 3.1\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.05\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 1.1\n        - 1.0\n        - 1.1\n        - 0.1\n        - 0.09\n      - - precision\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.6\n        - 0.3\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.2\n        - 0.33\n  - name: 'Table 5: G-coefficient stability'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - metric\n      - seed0_G\n      - seed7_G\n      - seed99_G\n      - mean_G\n      - sd_G\n      - cv\n      rows:\n      - - binary\n        - 0.611\n        - 0.528\n        - 0.697\n        - 0.612\n        - 0.085\n        - 0.139\n      - - text_exact\n        - 0.007\n        - 0.005\n        - 0.009\n        - 0.007\n        - 0.002\n        - 0.286\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: 三组200-item样本的方差分解并排stacked-bar。item_id始终是最大source但高度变化明显(52-68%)。添加误差线显示±1SD范围。'\n  analysis: 'resampling结果对论文有双重影响。负面：具体百分比不可作为precise point estimate， 需要报告range或bootstrap\n    CI，reviewer可以合理质疑\"为什么不用更大的item sample\"。 正面：item_id在所有3次抽样中都是最大的方差源(最低52.4%仍远超第二名residual的\n    22.8%)，定性结论robust。G系数的较低变异(CV=0.14)意味着reliability estimate 本身是stable的——即使方差成分百分比波动，最终的reliability判断不变。\n    论文策略：报告mean±SD而非point estimate，在Limitations中讨论200-item的局限性， 引用D-study中500+item的建议作为methodological回应。但这会让数字less\n    punchy， reviewer可能觉得\"连自己的item sample都不stable，怎么能给别人开D-study budgets\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-002: Multi-benchmark replication (partial)'\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '原计划4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings\n    × 200 items on GSM8K/ARC/HellaSwag。在worst档中，仅完成GSM8K(1个模型完整 + 1个模型部分)和ARC-Challenge(1个模型部分)。HellaSwag未开始。\n    时间被exp-001的4-model数据收集和debug消耗。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gsm8k_models_completed: 1.5\n    arc_models_completed: 0.7\n    hellaswag_models_completed: 0\n    total_benchmarks_with_usable_data: 2\n    total_benchmarks_fully_completed: 0\n    gsm8k_llama_records: 57600\n    gsm8k_llama_conditions: 288\n    gsm8k_llama_item_id_pct: 38.2\n    gsm8k_llama_residual_pct: 31.4\n    gsm8k_llama_prompt_template_item_id_pct: 12.8\n    gsm8k_llama_seed_item_id_pct: 6.1\n    gsm8k_llama_temperature_pct: 5.3\n    gsm8k_llama_precision_item_id_pct: 2.9\n    gsm8k_llama_precision_pct: 0.4\n    gsm8k_llama_G_binary: 0.421\n    gsm8k_llama_overall_accuracy: 0.487\n    arc_llama_records: 40320\n    arc_llama_conditions: 202\n    arc_llama_item_id_pct: 54.7\n    arc_llama_residual_pct: 20.3\n    arc_llama_prompt_template_item_id_pct: 7.2\n    arc_llama_G_binary: 0.563\n    arc_llama_overall_accuracy: 0.531\n    arc_data_quality_note: partial, missing T=0.7 conditions and orderings 3-4\n    mmlu_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    gsm8k_item_id_pct: 38.2\n    arc_item_id_pct: 54.7\n    benchmark_item_id_spread_pp: 22.9\n    benchmark_gradient_rank_corr: 0.0\n    mmlu_gsm8k_profile_corr: 0.42\n    mmlu_arc_profile_corr: 0.78\n    gsm8k_arc_profile_corr: 0.38\n    gsm8k_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 1.1\n    arc_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.6\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是数学推理任务，与MMLU的知识检索本质不同。GSM8K的item_id仅38.2%(vs MMLU 61.1%)的原因：数学题的难度方差较小——大多数GSM8K题都需要类似步骤数的算术推理，\n    item间difficulty差异不如MMLU(从trivia到advanced physics)那么大。相应地， prompt_template:item_id升至12.8%，因为chain-of-thought\n    prompt的具体措辞对 推理过程影响更大(某些prompt引导更好的step-by-step分解)。residual升至31.4% 反映了推理任务的内在随机性——同一条件下模型可能走不同推理路径得到不同结果。\n    temperature对GSM8K的影响更大(5.3% vs MMLU 1.2%)因为推理任务在T>0时的token sampling对中间步骤的影响会cascade到最终答案。ARC-Challenge(科学推理)的item_id\n    54.7%介于MMLU和GSM8K之间，但仅有部分数据不能做firm conclusion。 关键问题：3个数据点(MMLU 61%, ARC 55%, GSM8K\n    38%)没有形成任何可解释的梯度—— 按\"知识→推理\"排序是MMLU>ARC>GSM8K，看起来有趋势但(a)ARC也是部分数据， (b)HellaSwag缺失，(c)\n    3个点无法区分线性趋势和噪声(任何3点都可以拟合线性)。 Rank correlation无法计算或为trivially 1.0(3个点完美排序)，无统计意义。\n    infra×method在GSM8K上为1.1%(高于MMLU的<0.1%)，可能反映precision对推理中间 步骤的累积效应，但也可能是noise——CI会很宽。这个结果让\"separability\n    is benchmark-conditional\"无法作为firm claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Cross-benchmark variance decomposition (single-model Llama, binary)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - mmlu_pct\n      - gsm8k_pct\n      - arc_partial_pct\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 61.1\n        - 38.2\n        - 54.7\n      - - residual\n        - 17.2\n        - 31.4\n        - 20.3\n      - - prompt_template:item_id\n        - 4.6\n        - 12.8\n        - 7.2\n      - - seed:item_id\n        - 4.7\n        - 6.1\n        - 5.8\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.2\n        - 5.3\n        - 3.1\n      - - precision:item_id\n        - 7.2\n        - 2.9\n        - 5.2\n      - - temperature:item_id\n        - 3.1\n        - 1.8\n        - 2.4\n      - - precision\n        - 0.5\n        - 0.4\n        - 0.3\n      - - other\n        - 0.4\n        - 1.1\n        - 1.0\n  - name: 'Table 7: G-coefficients by benchmark'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - benchmark\n      - n_items\n      - G_binary\n      - G_text_exact\n      - data_completeness\n      rows:\n      - - MMLU\n        - 200\n        - 0.611\n        - 0.007\n        - 100%\n      - - GSM8K\n        - 200\n        - 0.421\n        - 0.003\n        - 100% (1 model)\n      - - ARC-Challenge\n        - 200\n        - 0.563\n        - 0.006\n        - ~70% (1 model)\n      - - HellaSwag\n        - 200\n        - null\n        - null\n        - 0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: 3-benchmark stacked-bar图（MMLU/GSM8K/ARC），但ARC标注''partial data''虚线边框。没有清晰的monotonic梯度——更像是每个benchmark有自己的idiosyncratic方差签名。'\n  analysis: 'exp-002的部分完成是worst档的核心打击之一。原计划的\"cross-benchmark gradient\" 需要4+ benchmarks才能做credible的趋势分析，现在只有1.5-2个可用benchmark。\n    MMLU 61% vs GSM8K 38%的差异是real的，但2个数据点无法支撑\"gradient\"叙事—— reviewer会问\"这只是两个不同benchmark有不同方差结构，这不是trivially\n    obvious吗？\" ARC的部分数据(54.7%)暗示MMLU和GSM8K之间可能有中间值，但数据不完整不能claim。 论文策略：完全放弃\"cross-benchmark\n    gradient\"作为finding，改为在Discussion中 报告MMLU vs GSM8K的差异作为\"preliminary observation\n    suggesting task-type dependence\"。GSM8K的数据可以用来支持\"metric-conditional\"叙事——GSM8K的\n    G=0.421(vs MMLU 0.611)意味着reasoning benchmarks需要更多items，但这是 a secondary point。主要损失：论文scope从\"multi-benchmark\"收缩为\"primarily\n    MMLU with limited cross-benchmark evidence\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-003: Multi-hardware G-study'\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '原计划4 models × 2+ GPU types × 2 precisions × full crossing on MMLU。\n    在worst档中，exp-003完全缺失——第二种GPU类型从未获得。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    gpu_types_available: 1\n    second_gpu_acquired: false\n    records_collected: 0\n    blocking_reason: second GPU type not procured; Manager unable to allocate additional\n      hardware within timeline\n  result_rationale: 'exp-003的核心依赖是获得第二种GPU类型(如A100、H100或不同架构的consumer GPU)。 在worst档中，Manager未能在AAAI截稿前分配额外硬件——可能因预算审批延迟、\n    GPU集群排队过长、或所需硬件型号不可用。没有第二种GPU，\"multi-hardware crossing\" 无法执行。论文只能在单一GPU(RTX PRO\n    6000)上讨论\"numerical precision\"而非 \"hardware\"。这意味着Claim 2(Conditional Separability)中的\"infrastructure\"\n    实际上仅限于\"precision facet on a single GPU architecture\"——reviewer会指出 这是一个substantial\n    scope limitation。Yuan et al. (2025)记录的hardware-specific 差异(CUDA kernel implementation,\n    memory bandwidth effects)完全无法验证。 但论文可以将此framing为\"precision is the infrastructure\n    facet we can study; hardware crossing is future work\"——这是honest但weakens the contribution。\n    exp-003的缺失也影响exp-004(无hardware数据可分析)和exp-005(deps on exp-003)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-003缺失是worst档的defining characteristic之一。impact chain: (1) Claim 2的\"infrastructure\"缩窄为\"precision\"；\n    (2) exp-004的hardware分析完全消失； (3) exp-005被block； (4) \"fully crossed infrastructure\n    × methodology\"的framing需要大幅qualifier； (5) 论文title如果含\"hardware\"需要修改。 Mitigation：将exp-003的缺失作为explicit\n    limitation，引用Yuan et al. (2025)的 hardware结果作为motivation for future work，强调我们的precision分析是\n    complementary而非替代。在rebuttal策略中准备\"we agree hardware crossing is essential and plan\n    to include it in camera-ready\"（如果能在rebuttal期间拿到GPU）。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-004: Comprehensive analysis (partial)'\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '基于exp-001/001b/002/003数据的全面分析。在worst档中，缺失exp-003数据， exp-002仅有部分数据。分析范围大幅收缩。仍可执行的分析：\n    (a) 4-model G-theory交叉分析(exp-001)，(b) bootstrap CIs，(c) IRT对比， (d) 温度分层，(e) 固定vs随机敏感性，(f)\n    D-study投影。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    planned_analyses: 17\n    executable_analyses: 11\n    blocked_analyses: 6\n    irt_recommended_items_mmlu: 142\n    gtheory_recommended_items_mmlu_practical: 468\n    gtheory_recommended_items_mmlu_all_random: 498\n    irt_vs_gtheory_item_ratio_practical: 3.3\n    irt_vs_gtheory_item_ratio_all_random: 3.51\n    irt_gtheory_gap_attribution:\n      prompt_x_item_contribution_pct: 32\n      seed_x_item_contribution_pct: 28\n      ordering_residual_contribution_pct: 40\n    item_id_pct_CI_95:\n    - 56.8\n    - 65.4\n    model_x_item_4model_pct_CI_95:\n    - 3.1\n    - 12.8\n    residual_pct_CI_95:\n    - 15.3\n    - 23.1\n    G_binary_CI_95:\n    - 0.571\n    - 0.652\n    cross_model_G_4model_CI_95:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.4\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_mean: 1.01\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_range:\n    - 0.96\n    - 1.04\n    G_all_random: 0.594\n    G_temp_fixed: 0.628\n    G_ordering_fixed: 0.641\n    G_both_fixed: 0.664\n    fixed_random_max_delta_G: 0.07\n    d_study_items_G80_practical: 468\n    d_study_items_G80_all_random: 498\n    d_study_items_G90_practical: 1240\n    d_study_items_G90_all_random: 1380\n    d_study_14k_items_G_projected: 0.972\n    bernoulli_variance_obs_variance_corr: 0.91\n    null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n    obs_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n    min_detectable_interaction_pct: 0.8\n    power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.94\n    power_at_5pct_interaction: 0.99\n    gpu_hours_for_G80_budget: 340\n    gpu_hours_for_G90_budget: 890\n  result_rationale: 'IRT vs G-theory对比是worst档中最重要的surviving finding。ratio降至3.3-3.5×\n    (vs原预期的3.6-4.4×)因为：(1) IRT在4-model数据上估计更保守(142 items vs 原2-model数据的116 items)，缩小了分母差距；(2)\n    G-theory的D-study在4-model 分析中因model×item降至7.3%而需要fewer items来compensate，numerator从510\n    降至498。但3.3×仍然是substantial——意味着IRT忽略的facets(prompt, seed, ordering) 贡献了约70%的额外item需求。这个finding不依赖model×item的magnitude，因此\n    在worst档中仍然robust。 Bootstrap CIs显示item_id的95% CI为[56.8, 65.4]，range=8.6pp——与exp-001b的\n    resampling变异一致，进一步确认point estimate的精度有限。model×item的4-model CI为[3.1, 12.8]，range很宽(9.7pp)，包含0附近——reviewer可能argue\n    \"model×item is not reliably different from zero with only 4 models\"。这是对原Claim\n    1的 又一打击：不仅point estimate从26%降至7%，CI还包含了trivially small values。 Fixed vs random\n    sensitivity分析显示delta仅0.070——这是一个正面结果，说明 facet classification choice对G影响不大，MD2\n    defense成立。 D-study投影到14K items给出G=0.972——这回应了MD5 \"MMLU is unreliable\"的误读， 但468\n    items for G≥0.80(vs原文510)的变化需要更新所有D-study tables。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: IRT vs G-theory item requirements comparison'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - method\n      - framework\n      - recommended_items\n      - target\n      - accounts_for\n      rows:\n      - - IRT_2PL\n        - IRT\n        - 142\n        - SE<0.3\n        - item difficulty + discrimination\n      - - G_practical\n        - G-theory\n        - 468\n        - G≥0.80\n        - item + prompt + seed + ordering (temp/prec fixed)\n      - - G_all_random\n        - G-theory\n        - 498\n        - G≥0.80\n        - item + prompt + seed + ordering + temp + prec\n      - - G_high_rel\n        - G-theory\n        - 1240\n        - G≥0.90\n        - item + prompt + seed + ordering (temp/prec fixed)\n  - name: 'Table 9: Bootstrap CIs on 4-model variance components'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - source\n      - point_est_pct\n      - ci_lower\n      - ci_upper\n      - ci_width\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 42.1\n        - 36.5\n        - 47.8\n        - 11.3\n      - - model\n        - 18.6\n        - 12.1\n        - 25.4\n        - 13.3\n      - - residual\n        - 19.8\n        - 15.3\n        - 23.1\n        - 7.8\n      - - model_x_item\n        - 7.3\n        - 3.1\n        - 12.8\n        - 9.7\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 4.2\n        - 2.8\n        - 5.9\n        - 3.1\n      - - seed_x_item\n        - 3.9\n        - 2.5\n        - 5.6\n        - 3.1\n      - - precision_x_item\n        - 2.4\n        - 1.1\n        - 4.0\n        - 2.9\n      - - temperature\n        - 1.1\n        - 0.4\n        - 2.2\n        - 1.8\n  - name: 'Table 10: D-study projections (4-model, binary metric)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - design\n      - n_items\n      - n_prompts\n      - n_seeds\n      - G_projected\n      - ci_95\n      rows:\n      - - current_practice\n        - 200\n        - 1\n        - 1\n        - 0.594\n        - '[0.571, 0.652]'\n      - - practical_G80\n        - 468\n        - 2\n        - 3\n        - 0.801\n        - '[0.782, 0.831]'\n      - - all_random_G80\n        - 498\n        - 2\n        - 3\n        - 0.8\n        - '[0.778, 0.825]'\n      - - practical_G90\n        - 1240\n        - 3\n        - 4\n        - 0.901\n        - '[0.887, 0.918]'\n      - - full_mmlu\n        - 14042\n        - 6\n        - 6\n        - 0.972\n        - '[0.968, 0.979]'\n  - name: 'Table 11: Fixed vs random facet sensitivity (MD2)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - configuration\n      - G_binary\n      - delta_from_all_random\n      rows:\n      - - all_random\n        - 0.594\n        - 0.0\n      - - temp_fixed\n        - 0.628\n        - 0.034\n      - - ordering_fixed\n        - 0.641\n        - 0.047\n      - - temp+ordering_fixed\n        - 0.664\n        - 0.07\n  - name: 'Table 12: Bootstrap vs Jackknife CI comparison (MD6)'\n    data:\n      columns:\n      - component\n      - bootstrap_ci_width\n      - jackknife_ci_width\n      - ratio\n      rows:\n      - - item_id\n        - 8.6\n        - 8.4\n        - 1.02\n      - - residual\n        - 7.8\n        - 8.1\n        - 0.96\n      - - model_x_item\n        - 9.7\n        - 9.4\n        - 1.03\n      - - prompt_x_item\n        - 3.1\n        - 3.0\n        - 1.03\n      - - G_binary\n        - 0.081\n        - 0.079\n        - 1.03\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: D-study curve — G vs item count，显示IRT曲线(陡峭上升，142 items达到目标)和G-theory曲线(缓慢上升，468\n    items达到G≥0.80)。两曲线的gap用阴影标注，标签''cost of multi-facet reliability''。'\n  - 'Fig 6: 温度分层G系数热力图 — 3 temperatures × 2 metrics。binary从T=0.0(0.760)降至T=0.7(0.549)，text_exact_match全部<0.01。'\n  analysis: 'exp-004在worst档中的核心价值：IRT对比(3.3×)和方法学robustness package。 IRT对比是self-contained的——不需要4-model结果或cross-benchmark数据，完全基于\n    已完成的单模型Llama MMLU数据。3.3×的ratio比原预期低，但仍是\"首个G-theory vs IRT直接对比\"的文献贡献。Bootstrap\n    CIs的宽度(model×item CI包含接近0的值)进一步 支持将model×item降级为\"preliminary\"的策略。方法学robustness的6项验证全部\n    基于exp-001 Llama数据，不受worst档的数据缺失影响——这是论文的\"guaranteed floor\"。 Missing analyses:\n    hardware crossing(exp-003缺失)、full cross-benchmark gradient (exp-002不完整)、full logprob\n    analysis across benchmarks(只能做MMLU)。 论文需要在Methods中明确标注哪些分析是\"planned but not completed\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-005: 14B model extension'\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上的BF16/FP16测试。 在worst档中，因exp-003缺失(deps)且无可用的48GB+\n    VRAM GPU而完全未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    blocking_reason: Depends on exp-003 (not completed); no 48GB+ VRAM GPU available\n    records_collected: 0\n  result_rationale: 'exp-005有两个blocking依赖：(1) exp-003需要先完成以确定multi-hardware protocol；\n    (2) 14B模型需要≥48GB VRAM GPU(RTX PRO 6000的96GB可以跑，但如果被exp-001/002 占用则无法parallel执行)。在worst档中exp-003未完成，且GPU时间被P0实验消耗，\n    P1实验无法启动。这意味着论文没有model scale的evidence——所有结论限于7-9B模型。 reviewer concern \"Missing\n    scale validation\"完全无法回应。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-005缺失意味着reviewer concern #6 \"Missing scale validation\"只能在Limitations\n    中acknowledge。论文需要argue \"7-9B models represent the most commonly used open-weight\n    model class\"并cite usage statistics。但sophisticated reviewer会 指出14B+模型可能有qualitatively\n    different variance structure(更稳定的internal representations → lower item×model interaction)。这是一个honest\n    limitation， 不fatal但weakens generalizability claims。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-006: Fine-tuning G-study'\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large在SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA上的fine-tuning方差分解。 在worst档中未执行——P1优先级，GPU时间不足。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    blocking_reason: P1 priority; GPU budget exhausted by P0 experiments\n    records_collected: 0\n  result_rationale: 'exp-006需要1,728次fine-tuning runs × ~15min each ≈ 430 GPU-hours。在worst档中\n    P0实验消耗了大部分GPU预算(exp-001 ~100h实际可能超支至130h due to reruns， exp-002 ~80h for partial\n    completion)，剩余GPU时间不足以执行P1实验。 此外，exp-006是encoder-only(RoBERTa) fine-tuning，与主论文的decoder\n    LLM inference focus有methodological gap——即使完成，reviewer可能argue \"fine-tuning variance\n    structure is a different question\"。在worst档的reframed narrative中(focus on metric-conditional\n    reliability)，fine-tuning分析不是 核心贡献，缺失的impact有限。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-006缺失不fatal。论文可以在Future Work中提到\"extending G-theory to fine-tuning\n    variance decomposition\"作为natural extension。reviewer concern #5 \"No training-time\n    analysis\"的回应是\"this paper focuses on inference-time evaluation reliability; fine-tuning\n    stability is a complementary question studied by Dodge et al. (2020) and Sellam\n    et al. (2022)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-007: LayerCast precision mitigation'\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为额外precision条件。 P2优先级，在worst档中未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    blocking_reason: P2 priority; not attempted within timeline\n    records_collected: 0\n  result_rationale: 'P2实验在worst档中完全被deprioritize。LayerCast是一个mitigation strategy的\n    evaluation——属于\"nice to have\"而非核心贡献。论文可以在Discussion中提到 LayerCast作为\"practitioners\n    can reduce precision-related variance via mixed precision strategies\"的建议，无需实验数据支撑(cite\n    existing LayerCast papers)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '零影响。LayerCast从未进入任何版本的核心claims。\n\n    '\n- name: 'exp-008: MATH benchmark'\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'MATH benchmark(200 items)测试reasoning-heavy任务的item dominance。 P2优先级且deps\n    on exp-002，在worst档中未执行。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    status: NOT_COMPLETED\n    blocking_reason: P2 priority; depends on exp-002 (incomplete)\n    records_collected: 0\n  result_rationale: 'exp-008依赖exp-002的multi-benchmark infrastructure和protocol。exp-002本身\n    在worst档中仅部分完成，exp-008作为P2自然被skip。MATH作为reasoning benchmark 可能会显示更低的item_id(类似GSM8K的38%)和更高的residual，但没有数据只能\n    在Discussion中speculate。reviewer concern \"Only MMLU\"的回应依赖GSM8K的 部分数据(\"we have preliminary\n    evidence from GSM8K suggesting task-type dependence\")。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'exp-008缺失加剧了\"primarily MMLU\"的scope limitation，但由于worst档已放弃 cross-benchmark\n    gradient叙事，这个实验的缺失与narrative adjustment是consistent的。\n\n    '\n","numLines":874,"startLine":1,"totalLines":874}}}
