{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MTWSehAzg2cihX9efHb4Qy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp001_qwen | Qwen3-8B variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) completes the 4-model design for cross-model G-theory analysis — tests whether item_id dominance and model×item interaction patterns hold with a 4th architecturally distinct model (Claim 1) | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp001_mistral** (success): Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) will contribute to cross-model G-theory analysis — model-as-facet tests whether item_id dominance holds across architecturally diverse models (Claim 1) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\\\n- **exp001_gemma** (success): Gemma-2-9b-it variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) will show model-specific variance structure differences compared to Llama — enabling model-as-facet analysis (Claim 1 make-or-break) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\\\n- **exp001_llama** (success): Single-model (Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct) G-theory variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items across 3 precisions × 3 temperatures × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 4 orderings) will confirm MVP findings: item_id dominates binary_correct variance, while text_exact_match reveals infrastructure×methodology interactions ← 基于 mvp_phase_a\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 6\\\\nitems_per_condition: 200 →（近 3 次 success）\\\\ntotal_records: 259200 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n